            <ArticleTitle>Chondroma of the lumbar spine, a rare cause of sciatica: case report.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>685-7; discussion 688</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A case of chondroma of the lumbar spine causing nerve root compression is presented. This benign tumor was completely removed, resulting in relief of all radicular symptoms.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
